          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Planning a wedding or large celebration? Start with the glow. Our bulk wedding candles events are designed to set the mood—whether you're lining the aisle, accenting table centerpieces, or filling the space with a soft, romantic atmosphere.</p><p>With a wide range of sizes and styles, you can choose what works best for your venue and vision. From dozens of unscented tapers to <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-tea-light-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-tea-light-candles\">bulk tea lights</a>, we make it easy to order exactly what you need, all in one place.</p><p>Need help with quantities or planning? Our team is here to guide you. Just reach out or set up a wholesale account to unlock exclusive savings, fast shipping, and hands-on support.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
