        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Classic. Timeless. Always in style. Bulk wedding candles remain a top choice for planners and couples alike. Why? Because nothing elevates a table setting or ceremony backdrop like the warm, steady glow of candles.<br/></p><p>Kisco offers clean-burning, unscented wedding candles in bulk, perfect for venues of every size. Mix and match heights to create layers of light, or keep it uniform—it’s your moment, your style.<br/></p><p>Pair pillars with clear hurricane glass or antique lanterns for extra impact. Planning a rustic theme? Try clusters of varying heights on wood slabs or vintage trays.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
