    "image_with_text_dNbdM3": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_tU6rmL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Wholesale Wedding Candle Packages – Save More",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_Afnn3H": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_kepcYj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Big weddings need bulk solutions, without the big price tag. That’s why we created wholesale wedding candle packages to give you serious savings without cutting corners.</p><p>While we don’t offer pre-bundled packs, our wide selection lets you build your own combination of tea lights, pillars, or <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\">tapers</a> to suit your venue layout and style. Mix and match sizes or stick to a single look—it’s all up to you.</p><p>Need help choosing quantities? Our team is happy to assist with custom recommendations based on your guest count and layout. Set up a wholesale account to get access to:</p><ul><li>Discounted rates on high-volume orders</li><li>Fast, reliable shipping</li><li>A dedicated rep for smooth ordering</li></ul><p>Light more. Spend less. That’s the Kisco way.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_tU6rmL",
