    "image_with_text_xibYzM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_BaGTjk": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Choose Kisco for Wholesale Wedding Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_fgCLEb": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_i6wFTU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Weddings demand details done right. That’s where Kisco Candles delivers. From the moment you order to the final flicker on your wedding night, our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/elegant-wedding-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/elegant-wedding-candles\">wedding candles</a> are made to impress.</p><p>What sets us apart?</p><ul><li>Quality craftsmanship: Clean-burning, dripless, and unscented—so your décor stays flawless and your venue stays fresh.</li><li>Reliable fulfillment: Bulk orders are packed with care and shipped fast to keep your planning on track.</li><li>Trusted by pros: Event planners, caterers, and venues rely on Kisco for consistency and customer service.</li></ul><p>Planning a wedding shouldn’t be stressful. When it comes to lighting, we’ve got you covered.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
